<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version toc3 Amo</book>
  <para style="toc2">Amosi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Amosi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ichitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Amosi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu achino china usenga wa unabii wa Amosi. Amosi tsakakala imunu iyodima (1.1) na iyolima (7.14). Naye Imulungu tsakamkema yawe nabii wake. Amosi tsakalawa kuna ghumji ghwa Tekoa, ghumji ighukalile mna tsifalume tsa kusini tsa Yuda, lekeni unabii wake mkulu ulonga tsimbuli tsa ufalume wa kasikazini wa Isiraeli. Amosi tsakalapfa unabii ahala Uzia hayakalile mfalume wa Yuda, na Yeroboamu wa keli hayakalile mfalume wa Isiraeli. Amosi tsakalonga unabii miyaka miya saba na hamsini ng'ana Kristu yoneke.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mna tsisula mbili tsa mwanduso Amosi tsakatabili apfila iwanu wa isi nyingi pfawatsohighighwa. Lekeni unabii wake mkulu tsakailapfila isi ya Isiraeli. Achino tsachikala chipindi cha ukubweda kwa Waisiraeli. Lekeni hawang'ali wobweda, tsawamsemwa ghendo Imulungu na wawatendela pfihile iwanu wahingwa (2: 6). Ukuhighighwa kwao na Imulungu tsawabamighwa wose waghalighwe kuna isi ya utumwa (7.17). Hata apfo Imulungu keka laghano lya ukuwapfila Waisiraeli kutsiboka keli tsiisi tsingi tsose itsiwatawale aho mwanduso (9.12).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna Ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Amosi kolonga yeye yali nani, mna ghumstali ghwa mwanduso.</para>
  <para style="io">Amosi kolonga isi tsingi pfatsitsohighighwa, isula ya 1 na 2.</para>
  <para style="io">Waisiraeli pfawatsohighighwa na pfawatsoghalighwa kuna utumwa isula ya 3-9.11.</para>
  <para style="io">Imulungu kolonga apfila pfawatsowoyitsa iwanu iwasighale wa isi ya Isiraeli, isula ya 9.12-15.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="AMO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 1:1" />Aghano ghagho ghamalonga gha Amosi yumwe wa iwadimi wa wang'olo wa ghumji ghwa Tekoa. Imulungu tsakamghubulila ghamaono gha iwanu wa Isiraeli miyaka mili ng'ana isi ihighisike baye, ahala Uzia hayakalile mfalume wa Yuda na Yeroboamu hayakalile mfalume wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="AMO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 1:2" />Amosi tsakalonga apfino: Imulungu koduma kulawa kuna ichidunda cha Sayuni, kolapfa litsi lyake kulawa Yerusalemu, imighunda ya ukudimila iwanyama yosakala na imitsani mna chidunda cha Kalimeli yosakala.<verse eid="AMO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu koghuhigha ghumji ghwa Damasko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 1:3" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino, “Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Damasko tsawatenda nzambi keli na keli, apfo nene sitsoleka kuwahigha baye kwaapfila wawakana iwanu wa Gileadi kwa ipfinu pfa ukupfunila. <verse eid="AMO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 1:4" />Nitsoghala ghumoto mna ing'anda ya Hazaeli nagho ghutsolakatsa tsing'anda tsinoghile tsa mfalume Benihadadi. <verse eid="AMO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 1:5" />Nitsobena ipfinu pfa kuhindila ghamalango gha ghumji ghwa Damasko, na kuwalapfa iwanu iwokala mna ilwanda lwa Aveni, na mkulu wa Betedeni na iwanu wa Aramu watsoghalighwa wahamile Kiri.”<verse eid="AMO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu koghuhigha ghumji ghwa Filistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 1:6" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino, “Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Gaza tsawatenda nzambi keli na keli, apfo nene sitsoleka kuwahigha baye, kwaapfila wawaghogha iwanu kabila lyose wawatenda wawe watumwa kwa Waedomu. <verse eid="AMO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 1:7" />Lelo nitsoghala ghumoto mna ubanda wa ghumji ghwa Gaza, nagho ghutsolakatsa ghendo tsingome tsake. <verse eid="AMO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 1:8" />Nitsowakoma ghendo iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Ashidodi, na imkulu wa Ashikeloni. Nitsoghuhigha ghumji ghwa Ekironi, na Wafilisti wose iwasighale watsokomighwa.”<verse eid="AMO 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu koghuhigha ghumji ghwa Tiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 1:9" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino, “Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Tilo tsawatenda nzambi keli na keli, apfo nene sitsoleka kuwahigha ghendo baye kwaapfila wawaghogha iwanu wose wa Edomu wala ng'awakumbuke baye lilaghano lya undughu lyawelaghane. <verse eid="AMO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 1:10" />Lelo nitsoghala ghumoto mna ubanda wa ghumji ghwa Tiro, nagho ghutsolakatsa ghendo tsingome tsake.”<verse eid="AMO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu koghuhigha ghumjii ghwa Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 1:11" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino, “Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Edomu tsawatenda nzambi keli na keli, apfo nene sitsoleka kuwahigha baye, kwaapfila wawo tsawawawinzilitsa ndughu tsawo Waisiraeli kwa ghamapanga, ng'awawonele libatsi baye, na imaya yawo ng'aimalile baye tsawakala na maya matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="AMO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 1:12" />Lelo nitsoghala ghumoto mna ghumji ghwa Temani na kutsilakatsa ghendo tsingome tsa Bosra.”<verse eid="AMO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu ghoghuhigha ghumji ghwa Amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 1:13" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino, “Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Amoni tsawatenda nzambi keli na keli, apfo nene sitsoleka kuwahigha baye. Kwaapfila wawatumbula iwapinga wana inda mna isi ya Gileadi hawang'ali woitowa wongetse ukulu wa isi yawo. <verse eid="AMO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 1:14" />Lelo nitsoghala ghumoto mna ubanda wa ghumji ghwa Raba, nagho ghutsolakatsa ghendo tsingome tsake. Litsuwa alyo lya ing'ondo litsakuwa na chililo chikulu, na ing'ondo ayo itsakuwa ng'ulu ka nyahemu. <verse eid="AMO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 1:15" />Nene Imulungu nolonga, mfalume wawo na iwakulu wake watsoghenda kukala akula kwawaghalighwe wahamile.”<verse eid="AMO 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="AMO 2" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu koghuhigha ghumji ghwa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 2:1" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino: “Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Moabu tsawatenda nzambi keli na keli, apfo nene sitsoleka baye kuwahigha kwaapfila walakatsa imipate ya mfalume wa Edomu mbaka iwa lipfu. <verse eid="AMO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 2:2" />Lelo nitsoghala ghumoto mna isi ya Moabu nagho ghutsolakatsa ghendo tsingome tsa ghumji ghwa Kerioti. Maasikali hawatsokemelela na kutowa malati, iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Moabu watsakufa kwa ing'ondo ayo. <verse eid="AMO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 2:3" />Pfipfila nene IMNDEWA nitsomkoma imtawala wa isi ya Moabu na wapfilongotsi wose wa isi ayo.”<verse eid="AMO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu koghuhigha ghumji ghwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 2:4" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino: “Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Yuda tsawatenda nzambi keli na keli, apfo nene sitsoleka kuwahigha ghendo baye. Kwaapfila waghabetsa malaghitso ghangu na ng'awawinzile aghala ghaniwalongele. Waghisighwa na imilungu ya ughutsu, aila yawaitambikile iwakulu wawo. <verse eid="AMO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 2:5" />Lelo nitsoghala ghumoto mna isi ya Yuda, na kulakatsa ghendo tsingome tsa Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="AMO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kowahigha Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 2:6" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino, “Iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Isiraeli tsawatenda nzambi keli na keli, apfo nene sitsowaleka kuwahigha baye. Wawachuutsa iwanu wangu iwana ihaki kwa fetsa, na iwanu iwahingwa wawautsa kwa imikwabatsa. <verse eid="AMO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 2:7" />Wowonela iwanu nyondenyonde na iwahingwa wowatenda waleke kupata haki tsawo. Imunu na imwanaghe wowasa na pinga yumwe, apfo wolitenda litaghwa lyangu ilyelile, lihe. <verse eid="AMO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 2:8" />Wowasila ghamabwende hanu ha ukutambikila, ghawasolile kwa iwahingwa iwekile poni, na mna ing'anda ya imulungu wawo wakunwa idipfai ighulighwe kwa pfetsa tsawalihile iwanu. <verse eid="AMO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 2:9" />Hata apfo, tsakawakoma ghendo Waamori kwaajili yawo, iwakalile watali ka mikataluba, na iwana tsingupfu ka miyaloni. <verse eid="AMO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 2:10" />Nimlapfani kulawa kuna isi ya Misiri, tsaniwalongotsa kubitila mna inyika kwa miyaka alubaini, mbaka muiboka isi ya Waamori iwe yenu. <verse eid="AMO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 2:11" />Niwasaghula iwana wenu wamale wamwenga wawe manabii, na iwasongolo wenu wamwenga niwabaghula wawe wanu iwomsang'anila Imulungu iwokemighwa wanatsili. Angu mwemwe Waisiraeli aghano ghanilonga noghutsuka? Nene IMNDEWA yanilonga apfo.” <verse eid="AMO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 2:12" />Lekeni mwemwe tsamuwatenda Wanatsili wanwe dipfai, na muwaghoma manabii waleke kulapfa unabii. <verse eid="AMO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 2:13" />“Lelo nitsowahonda ka pfaghuhonda ghumtuka ghumemile ingano. <verse eid="AMO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 2:14" />Hata awala iwotsuma ng'ani ng'awotsodaha ukuswekuka baye, na wana tsingupfu watsotenyuka na maasikali wana ingupfu ng'awatsodaha baye kwikombola. <verse eid="AMO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 2:15" />Watoa minde mna ing'ondo ng'awatsakwima ghoya baye wala wadinafalasi ng'awatsodaha kwikombola baye. <verse eid="AMO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 2:16" />Mna litsuwa alyo hata maasikali wana ingupfu watsotsuma aku wachidako.” Nene IMNDEWA Imulungu nilonga apfo.<verse eid="AMO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="AMO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 3:1" />Mwemwe Waisiraeli mtegheletse longa lyamlongelighwe na nene IMNDEWA Imulungu, mwemwe yaniwalapfile kuna isi ya Misiri: <verse eid="AMO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 3:2" />“Nene nimsaghulani mwemwe mliyeka kulawa mna iwanu wose wali muisi, apfo nitsowahigha mwemwe kwa ghehile ghenu ghose ghamtenda.”<verse eid="AMO 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'ano ya nabii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 3:3" />Angu iwanu weli wodaha kwanga hamwe ka ng'awelaghane baye?<verse eid="AMO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 3:4" />Pfii simba kodaha kuduma kumuhulo ka ng'aghoghile imnyama baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:4">Angu isimba mdoghodogho kodaha kuduma mna mango yake ka ng'aghoghile chinu baye?<verse eid="AMO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 3:5" />Pfii ichideghe kodaha konzeka mna ghumtegho ka kuduhu ichijo mna inyonzo?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:5">Angu ghumtegho ghodaha kufatuka bila kudonzighwa na chinu?<verse eid="AMO 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 3:6" />Apfi iwanu ng'awopfuka baye aho imalati ya ing'ondo haitowighwa mna ghumji?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:6">Angu lijanga lyodaha kulawila mna ghumji ka ng'alighalighwe na IMNDEWA?<verse eid="AMO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 3:7" />Nolonga ghendo IMNDEWA Imulungu ng'otenda chinu baye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:7">bila kuwaghubulila watumighwa wake manabii ichili mmoyo mwake.<verse eid="AMO 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 3:8" />Isimba yang'aduma, nani yoleka kupfuka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:8">IMNDEWA wetu Imulungu yang'alonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 3:8">nani iyenyamala yaleke kuulonga usenga wake?<verse eid="AMO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuhinyighwa kwa ghumji ghwa Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 3:9" />Mkatangatse usenga awo kuna iwanu iwokala mna tsing'anda tsa chifalume tsa Ashidodi na kuna iwanu iwokala mna tsing'anda tsa chifalume tsa isi ya Misiri, mkalonge apfino, “Mwitingane kuna ipfidunda ipfiitsunguluka isi ya Samaria, namwe mtsakona pfulughu na maghayo ighotendeka ako.”<verse eid="AMO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 3:10" />IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, “Iwanu awano ng'awamanyile ghendo baye kutenda ighanoghile, wawo wamemetsa tsing'anda tsawo ipfinu pfawebile na ukuboka.” <verse eid="AMO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 3:11" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino, “Maaduwi watsoitsunguluka isi yawo na kuhinya ubanda wawo na watsoboka ipfinu pfili mna tsing'anda tsawo tsinoghile.”<verse eid="AMO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 3:12" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga pfino: “Ka imdimi pfayomboka isimba mighulu mili au chihande cha lighutwi mna ghumlomo, pfipfo pfawatsokombolighwa iwanu chidogho wa Waisiraeli iwokala Samaria, na chihande cha ilusatsi na chihande cha litandiko. <verse eid="AMO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 3:13" />Mtegheletse aghano na mghende mkawakanye iwana wa Yakobo. Yanilonga apfo nene IMNDEWA yana tsingupfu tsose. <verse eid="AMO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 3:14" />Litsuwa lyanitsowahigha Waisiraeli kwa ajili ya tsinzambi tsawo pfipfila nitsohinya chila hanu ha ukutambikila ha ghumji ghwa Beteli. Nitsobena tsimembe tsa chila matsabahu, natso tsitsoghwisighwa hasi. <verse eid="AMO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 3:15" />Nitsomwagha tsing'anda tsawo tsawokalila mna ghumsimu ghwa ichipfeghetsi, na tsing'anda tsawo tsawokalila mna ghumsimu ghwa lijoto. Pfipfila nitotsimwagha tsing'anda tsawo tsikighwe unzolingo wa tsimembe tsa tembo, na tsing'anda tsawo tsing'ulu tsitsomwaghighwa, IMNDEWA yuyo iyolonga.”<verse eid="AMO 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="AMO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 4:1" />Tegheletseni lilonga alino, mwemwe iwapinga imli ka ng'ombe wa Basani, na imkala kuna ichidunda cha Samaria, mwemwe mwowadununza iwahingwa na kuwonela iwalihela chinu, na mwowalongela iwamale wenu wamghalileni idipfai mnwe! <verse eid="AMO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 4:2" />IMNDEWA Imulungu iyelile kelighita apfino, “Loleni mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa iwanu watsomkweghani kwa indoano ng'ulu, chila munu katsakuwa ka somba iyonzeke mna indoano. <verse eid="AMO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 4:3" />Mtsokweghighwa mbaka kuna ubanda wa ghumji, namwe mtsakwasighwa kunze kubitila hanu habomoke ha ubanda awo mbaka Harimoni.”<verse eid="AMO 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa Isiraeli ng'ana waghalambuke baye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 4:4" />“Mwemwe Waisiraeli lelo mghende Beteli mkatende nzambi, mghende Giligali mkongetse ukutenda tsinzambi! Lapfeni nambiko tsenu chila nemitondo na tsizaka tsenu chila haghomala matsuwa madatu. <verse eid="AMO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 4:5" />Lapfeni ipfighate ipfighelighwe hamila, pfiwe nambiko ya mighede. Longeni ka mlapfa kwa ukubama mwenyegho, namwe mwighodele tsinambiko atso, kwaapfila ukutenda apfo mwemwe komnoghelani.” Nene IMNDEWA Imulungu yanilonga apfo.<verse eid="AMO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 4:6" />“Nene nighala inzala mna imiji yenu, na mkala mwahela chijo mna tsikaye tsenu, lekeni mwemwe mlema kuya kuna nene. Yanilonga apfo nene IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="AMO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 4:7" />“Pfipfila tsaniighoma imvula ileke kutowa kuna mwemwe, aku ing'ali miyetsi midatu kupfika ghumsimu ghwa ukupfuna, imvula tsaitowa mna ghumji ghumwe na mna ghumji ghungi ng'aitowile baye, mghunda ghumwe tsaghupata mvula, na ghungi ng'aghupatile mvula baye, nagho ghunyala. <verse eid="AMO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 4:8" />Iwanu wa miji mili au midatu tsawatsumila kuna ghumji ghungi ili wabame ghamatsi lekeni ng'aghawenele baye, lekeni mwemwe mlema ukumbuyila nene.” Nene IMNDEWA yanilonga apfo.<verse eid="AMO 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 4:9" />Tsangala chiyangayanga na ng'ungughu, ghamakonde ghenu na imighunda yenu ya mitsabibu niitenda inyale, nawo wanzighe tsawaja imitini na imitseituni yenu, lekeni mwemwe mlema ukumbuiyila nene. Nene IMNDEWA Imulungu yanilonga apfo.<verse eid="AMO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 4:10" />“Tsaniwaghalila utamu wihile aula waniwaghalile iwanu wa isi ya Misiri. Tsaniwakoma iwasongolo wenu kuna ing'ondo na niwaboka falasi wenu wa ing'ondo. Ng'uli tsa iwasongolo wafile tsatsimema mna tsikaye tsenu, natso tsing'ali tsiwanung'ila pfihile mna tsimula tsenu, lekeni mwemwe mlema ukumbuyila nene.” Nene IMNDEWA Imulungu yanilonga apfo.<verse eid="AMO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 4:11" />“Wamwenga wenu niwahinya ka apfila pfaniwahinyile iwanu wa Sodoma na Gomora. Awala iwahonile tsawakala ka chitsinga chilapfighwe mna ghumoto, lekeni mwemwe tsamlema ukumbuyila nene.” Nene IMNDEWA Imulungu yanilonga apfo. <verse eid="AMO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 4:12" />“Apfo nene nitsowatenda chinu achino mwemwe Waisiraeli, na kwaapfila nene nitsotenda apfo, lelo mwiteghanye kwa ukwitingana na Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="AMO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 4:13" />Kwaapfila Imulungu yuyo yapfitendile ipfidunda na iyaumbile libeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">yeye yuyo iyomghubulila imunu ghamawatso ghake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">yeye yuyo iyotenda misi iwe chilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">yeye yuyo iyobajugha ipfidanando pfa isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 4:13">Yeye taghwa lyake IMNDEWA Imulungu yana tsingupfu tsose!<verse eid="AMO 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="AMO 5" />
  <para style="s">Ukudomboketsa kwa Amosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 5:1" />Tegheletse imbuli aino mwemwe Waisiraeli, nene pfaniwadomboketsela,<verse eid="AMO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 5:2" />Isi ya Isiraeli ighwa, isi ikalile ka ipinga mwali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:2">nayo ng'aitsakwinuka keli baye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:2">Kalekighwa kayeka mna isi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:2">wala haduhu hata munu wa ukwimwinula.<verse eid="AMO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 5:3" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:3">wanu elufu imwe wa ghumji watsolawa na watsoghenda kwitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:3">lekeni wanu miya imwe watsakuya wagima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:3">wanu miya imwe wa ghumji ghumwe watsakuka lekeni iwatsohona wanu kumi.<verse eid="AMO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 5:4" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kowalongela apfino Waisiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:4">“Mnibame namwe mtsokala wagima!<verse eid="AMO 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 5:5" />Lekeni mleke kughenda Beteli wala Giligali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:5">wala mleke kughenda Beeri Sheba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:5">kwaapfila iwanu iwokala Giligali watsoghalighwa kuna utumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:5">na ghumji ghwa Beteli ghutsohinyighwa.”<verse eid="AMO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 5:6" />Mbameni IMNDEWA namwe mtsokala wagima!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:6">Mng'aleka ukutenda apfo, yeye katsowalambita iwelekighwa wa Yosefu na ghumoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:6">nagho ghutsowalakatsa iwanu wa Beteli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:6">na kuduhu hata munu iyatsodaha kughutsima.<verse eid="AMO 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 5:7" />Mwemwe yamtenda ihaki iwe chinu cha usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:7">na imtenda ihaki yoneke si chinu baye.<verse eid="AMO 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 5:8" />Yeye yatsitendile tsinondo tsa Chilimila na Orioni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">iyotenda chilo chikulu chiwe nemitondo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">na misi iwe chilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">iyoghakema ghamatsi gha ibahali ghakale hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">na iyoghalekelela mna isi inyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:8">IMNDEWA Imulungu lilyo litaghwa lyake.<verse eid="AMO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 5:9" />Yeye yuyo iyowamalitsa wana tsingupfu na kuhinya tsingome tsawo.<verse eid="AMO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 5:10" />Mwemwe mwomwihila imunu iyokembela, na mwombetsa ayula iyolongesa mna libalatsa.<verse eid="AMO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 5:11" />Mwemwe mwowadidimitsa iwahingwa na mwowananahitsa walihe ngoto ng'ulu ya ingano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:11">lelo hata ka mtsenga tsing'anda tsa ghambawe gha bei ng'ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:11">lekeni ng'amtsokala amwo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:11">hata ka mlima mighunda inoghile ya minzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:11">lekeni idipfai yake ng'amtsakunwa baye.<verse eid="AMO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 5:12" />Kwaapfila nene nomanya pfamtotsile ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:12">na tsinzambi tsenu pfatsili nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:12">mwemwe mwowadununza iwanu wana ihaki na mwobokela hongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:12">na mowaghoma iwahinghwa waleke ukupata ihaki kuna libalatsa.<verse eid="AMO 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 5:13" />Apfo mna ghamatsuwa agho, imunu yana ihekima katsenyamala tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:13">kwaapfila agho ghatsakuwa matsuwa ghehile.<verse eid="AMO 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 5:14" />Mtende ighanoghile na si ghehile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:14">ili mkale wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:14">naye IMNDEWA iyana tsingupfu yamlongagha kahamwe na mwemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:14">yakale hamwe na mwemwe.<verse eid="AMO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 5:15" />Mleke kunoghelwa na ighehile, Ila mnoghelwe na ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:15">ghendeleleni ukulamla ghoya mna libalatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:15">songaha IMNDEWA katsowonela libatsi iwanu wa Yosefu iwalekighwe wagima.<verse eid="AMO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 5:16" />Lelo apfino pfipfo pfayolonga IMNDEWA, IMNDEWA Imulungu yana tsingupfu tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:16">kutsakuwa na chililo mna chila nzila ng'ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:16">na mna chila chibwalu cha ukwitinganila, iwanu watsodomboketsa apfino, “Twochona! Twochona!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:16">Iwanu iwolima watsokemighwa watse walile hamwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:16">na iwanu iwolihighwa iwadahile ukudomboketsa watsakutsa wadomboketse.<verse eid="AMO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 5:17" />Iwanu watsodomboketsa mna imighunda ya minzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:17">kwaapfila nene nitsobita haghatighati henu niwatowe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:17">Yanilonga apfo nene IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="AMO 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="AMO 5:18" />Mtsochona mwemwe yamlilolela litsuwa lya IMNDEWA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:18">Hebali mlilolela litsuwa lya IMNDEWA?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:18">Litsuwa alyo litsakuwa na chisi na si ghumwanga baye.<verse eid="AMO 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="AMO 5:19" />Itsakuwa ka imunu iyotsuma yampfuke isimba, kuya ketingana na dubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:19">au ka imunu iyakwingila mng'anda mwake kuya keka ghumoko ghwake mwibanda na baho inzoka kamluma.<verse eid="AMO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="AMO 5:20" />Angu litsuwa lya IMNDEWA ng'alitsakuwa na chisi, na si mwanga baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:20">Ona, litsakuwa na chisi totolo, na ng'alitsakuwa na mwanga baye.<verse eid="AMO 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="AMO 5:21" />IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, “Ipfihungo pfenu pfonyihila na nopfibetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:21">na imitingano yenu ya ukunitambikila nene yonyihila.<verse eid="AMO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="AMO 5:22" />Hata ka mtsonilapfila tsinambiko tsenu tsa ukulakatsighgwa na ipfijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:22">nene sitsotsibokela baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:22">na tsinambiko tsenu tsa ukukala tseghamba tsa wanyama iwanonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:22">nene sitsotsilola ghendo baye.<verse eid="AMO 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="AMO 5:23" />sibama baye kuhulika litsi lya tsiwila tsenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:23">na litsi lya ipfing'weng'we pfenu sitsohulikitsa baye.<verse eid="AMO 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="AMO 5:24" />Lekeni mleke ihaki ihulumke ka ghamatsi pfaghohulumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:24">na uluso wenu uwe ka chikolongo ing'achinyala.<verse eid="AMO 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="AMO 5:25" />Mwemwe Waisiraeli, pfihi tsamnilapfila pfinu na nambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:25">hamkalile kunyika kwa miyaka arobaini?<verse eid="AMO 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="AMO 5:26" />Lekeni mwoduta ipfinyagho pfa Sakuti mfalume wenu, na mwoduta ipfinyagho pfa Kaiwani mulungu wenu wa tsinondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:26">ipfinyagho pfamtendile mwemwe iwenyegho.<verse eid="AMO 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="AMO 5:27" />Apfo nitsowaghala kuna isi ya utumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:27">kutali kubita Damasko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:27">iyolonga apfo IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 5:27">litaghwa lyake kokemighwa Imulungu yana Tsingupfu Tsose.”<verse eid="AMO 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="AMO 6" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wohinyighwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 6:1" />Mtsochona mwemwe imkala kwa ukuhondola ako Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:1">na mwemwe yamwibona mkala tulu mna chidunda cha Samariya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:1">mwemwe imkoneka mwa pfilongotsi immanyika wa isi aino inoghile ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:1">na kuna mwemwe Waisiraeli wose watsowatsilani<verse eid="AMO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 6:2" />Mghende kuna ghumji ghwa Kaline, mkaghulole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:2">kuya mghende kuna ghumji mkulu ghwa Hamati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:2">mhulumke mbaka kuna Gati ako Filistia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:2">Pfihi falume tsawo tsina ngupfu kubita falume tsenu mbili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:2">Pfihi isi yawo ng'ulu kubita isi yenu?<verse eid="AMO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 6:3" />Mwemwe ng'amlipfikitsa baye litsuwa lihile ilikutsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:3">na kwa ukutenda apfo mwolitenda litsuwa lya maghayo liwe habehi ukupfika.<verse eid="AMO 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 6:4" />Mtsochona mwemwe yamuwasila ghamasatsi ighekighwe unzolingo wa membe tsa tembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:4">na ukwigholosa mna ipfighoda pfa bei ng'ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:4">aku mwakuja wang'olo iwanonile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:4">na wang'ombe iwanenehe.<verse eid="AMO 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 6:5" />Mwemwe mwotunga tsiwila tsa ubotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:5">na mwotengenetsa ipfing'weng'we ka pfa mfalume Daudi.<verse eid="AMO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 6:6" />Mwakunwa idipfai mna tsibakuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:6">na mwobakala ghamapfuta ighanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:6">lekeni mwahela usungu kwa ukukomighwa kwa iwelekighwa wa Yosefu.<verse eid="AMO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 6:7" />Apfo mwemwe mtsolongola kughalighwa kuna isi ya utumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:7">ipfihungo pfenu na ukuhondola kwenu kutsomala.<verse eid="AMO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 6:8" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kelahila imwenyegho kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:8">IMNDEWA Imulungu yana tsingupfu tsose kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:8">“Na ukwighoda kwa iwanu wa Yakobu nene kwonyihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:8">na tsing'anda tsawo tsinoghile tsonyihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:8">ghumji ghwao na chila chinu chili mumo nitsoweng'a maaduwi tsawo.”<verse eid="AMO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 6:9" />Ka wasighala wanu kumi mna ing'anda imwe, wose watsakufa.<verse eid="AMO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 6:10" />Ndughu wa imunu iyafile hayatsakutsa yalulapfe kunze ilukuli yakalulakatse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:10">na hayatsomghutsa imunu iyepfisile amwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:10">“Pfihi hana munu wowose iyali na ghweghwe?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:10">Naye yang'alonga, “Baye,” baho katsolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:10">“Winyamale tulu! Ng'atubamighwa baye tulitambule litaghwa lya IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="AMO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 6:11" />Lola, IMNDEWA kalapfa laghitso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:11">yeye katsolimwagha ling'anda likulu, lighwe pfihande pfihande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:11">na ing'anda ndodo ighwe pfihande pfidopfido.<verse eid="AMO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 6:12" />Angu wafalasi wodaha kutsuma mchanya mwa ghamabambalawe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:12">Apfi iwanu wodaha kulima kwa ng'ombe mna ibahali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:12">Lekeni mwemwe muitenda ihaki iwe sumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:12">na mtenda aghala ighanoghile ghoneke gheha.<verse eid="AMO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 6:13" />Mwemwe mwodeng'elela kughuboka ghumji ghwa Lodebari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:13">namwe mwolonga, “Tughuboka ghumji ghwa Karinaumu kwa tsingupfu tsetu tuwenyegho.”<verse eid="AMO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 6:14" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu yana tsingupfu tsose kolonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:14">“Mwemwe Waisiraeli, nitsoghala wanu wa isi imwe watse kuwatowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 6:14">nawo watsowadununza kwanzila kasikazini mwa Lebo Hamati mbaka ubali wa kusini wa ichiwala cha Araba.”<verse eid="AMO 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="AMO 7" />
  <para style="s">Maono gha wanzighe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 7:1" />Aghano ghagho ghayananguse IMNDEWA Imulungu mna ghamaono, tsanimwona Imulungu koweka ghoya wanzighe kwa ukuwatuma. Alino litsolawila ghendo ahala iwanu hawatsomalitsa kumpfunila ipfijo mfalume, na imitsani haitsakwanza kutsuka keli. <verse eid="AMO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 7:2" />Niwona wanzighe wakuja na kumalitsa chila tsani libisi lili muisi, baho nikemelela, nonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu nokudedetsa uwalekelele iwanu wako, iwanu wa Yakobu watsodahatse kuwa wagima? Lola wawo pfawali chidogho ghendo na pfawali nyonde nyonde.” <verse eid="AMO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 7:3" />Baho IMNDEWA kaghutuka, kuya kalonga, “Sitsotenda apfo baye.”<verse eid="AMO 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maono gha ghumoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 7:4" />Alino lilyo lyayananguse IMNDEWA mna ghamaono. Nimwona IMNDEWA Imulungu koghukema ghumoto yawahighile iwanu. Ghumoto agho ghulakatsa ibahali na isi isakale. <verse eid="AMO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 7:5" />Baho nikemelela, nonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu, leka kutenda apfo,. iwanu wa Yakobu watsodahatse kuwa wagima? Lola pfawali chidogho ghendo na pfawali nyonde nyonde.” <verse eid="AMO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 7:6" />Baho IMNDEWA kaghutuka, kuya kalonga, “Sitsotenda apfo baye.”<verse eid="AMO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maono gha timazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 7:7" />Alino lilyo lyayananguse IMNDEWA mna ghamaono. Nimwona IMNDEWA kema hana ubanda ugholoke, tsaulingighwa na lutsabi luning'inila libwe lya chuma lya ukulingila, ilikemighwe Timazi. Yeye Imulungu tsakakinda itimazi ayo mmoko mwake. <verse eid="AMO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 7:8" />IMNDEWA kangutsa apfino, “Amosi, chaukona choni?” Nimwidika, “Nakona Timazi.” Kuya IMNDEWA kalonga, “Lola nakwika itimazi iwalinge iwanu wangu Isiraeli. Nene sitsowaleka keli baye bila kuwahigha.” <verse eid="AMO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 7:9" />Chila hanu henulighwe ha Isaka ha ukutambikila milungu ingi hatsohinyighwa, na chila hanu helile ha Isiraeli ha ukutambikila milungu ingi pfipfila hatsohinyighwa, na nene nitsowenukila iwanu wa Yeroboamu na ukwitowa nawo.<verse eid="AMO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amosi na Amazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 7:10" />Kuya imtambika Amazia wa ghumji ghwa Beteli katuma wasenga wakamlongele Yeroboamu, mfalume wa Isiraeli apfino, Amosi kokutendela tsengwe mna iwanu wa Isiraeli. Iwanu iwali muisi ng'awodaha baye kughendelela kuhulikitsa chayolonga. <verse eid="AMO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 7:11" />Kwaapfila yeye kolonga apfino, “Yeroboamu katsakufa kwa ukukomighwa kung'ondo na iwanu wa Isiraeli watsoghalighwa kuna isi ya utumwa, isi ili kutali ghendo na isi yawo.” <verse eid="AMO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 7:12" />Kuya Amazia kamlongela Amosi, “Ghweghwe imunu yuutabili, uka ahano! Uye kuna isi ya Yuda, ukalapfe unabii wako ako na iwanu walikuko watsokwing'a ichijo. <verse eid="AMO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 7:13" />Uleke kulapfa unabii wako keli ahano Beteli, kwaapfila hanu ahano ha mfalume ha ukutambikila, na baho ing'anda ya chifalume.” <verse eid="AMO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 7:14" />Amosi kamwidika Amazia apfino, “Nene sili nabii baye wala sili mwana wa nabii baye. Nene na mdimi wa wanyama na notunza mibiki ya mikuyu. <verse eid="AMO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 7:15" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kanisola kulawa kuna ukudima wanyama, na kanongela apfino, ‘Ghenda ukawatabilie iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli.’ ” <verse eid="AMO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 7:16" />Lelo Amazia, tegheletsa chayolonga IMNDEWA, Ghweghwe konongela ndeke kulapfa unabii kuna iwanuwa Isiraeli, na ndeke kulonga chinu kwa welekighwa wa Isaka. <verse eid="AMO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 7:17" />Apfo IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, “Mwehe wako katsakuwa chiweghe mna ghumji, na iwanagho wamale na wapinga watsakomighwa kung'ondo, isi yako itsogholighwa na watsakwing'ighwa wanu wangi, naghwe ghumwenyegho kutsakufila kuna isi ihile. Na iwanu wa Isiraeli watsosolighwa na kughalighwa kuna isi ya utumwa.”<verse eid="AMO 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="AMO 8" />
  <para style="s">Ghamaono gha ichiseghe china ghamatunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 8:1" />Aghano ghagho ghayananguse IMNDEWA mna ghamaono. Mbona chiseghe chimemile ghamatunda gha msimu ghwa chiyangatsi. <verse eid="AMO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 8:2" />Naye IMNDEWA kangutsa apfino, “Amosi wonile choni?” Nene nimwidika, “Nakona chiseghe cha ghamatunda gha msimu ghwa chiyangatsi.” kuya IMNDEWA kanongela, “Ghamatsuwa gha ukuhupa kwa iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli ghapfika. Nene sitsoleka keli ukuwatowa baye.” <verse eid="AMO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 8:3" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino, “Mna litsuwa alyo tsiwila tsa ing'anda ya chifalume tsitsakuwa wila tsa ukulila. Tsing'uli tsa iwanu wafile tsiitsakuwa nyingi, natso tsitsakwasighwa kunze chila hanu tulutulu.”<verse eid="AMO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya Isiraeli itsochona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 8:4" />Tegheletseni alino mwemwe imuwadidimitsa iwanu iwalihela chinu, na imuwonela iwanu wahingwa iwali muisi. <verse eid="AMO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 8:5" />Mwemwe imlonga, “Ghumwetsi ghungi ghutsolawa tsuwachi ili tuutse ipfijo? Isabato itsomala tsuwachi ili tuutse ingano yetu? Mwohungutsa ipfipimo na mwakongetsa ibei, mwobugha iwanu kwa minzani ibunza, <verse eid="AMO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 8:6" />mwowaghula iwanu wahingwa kwa ifetsa, na iwanu iwalihela chinu kwa imikwabatsa, mwoutsa hata imibangu ya ingano ihanganyike na ingano yenyegho.”<verse eid="AMO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 8:7" />IMNDEWA Imulungu, kolonga, “Hata ka mwemwe mweghoda kwa kuwa welekighwa wa Yakobu, nene sitsesemwa ghendo baye chochose chawatendile. <verse eid="AMO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 8:8" />Angu isi ng'aitsodedemeka baye kwa alino, na chila munu iyokala amwo ng'atsolila baye? Isi yose itsakwinuka na ukughwa, itsakuwa ka ghumto Naili pfaghumema ghamatsi na kughwa ka ghumto agho Naili ghwa Misiri. <verse eid="AMO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 8:9" />IMNDEWA Imulungu, kolonga, Mna litsuwa alyo nitsolitenda litsuwa litsame saa sita nemisi, na nemisi itsakuwa chisi totolo. <verse eid="AMO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 8:10" />Nene nitsotenda ipfihungo pfenu pfiwe chililo, tsiwila tsenu tsa ukudeng'elela tsitsakuwa wila tsa ukudomboketsa, nitsowatenda mpfale ghamaghunila, na mtsobeya tsimvili tsenu. Nene nitsotenda muwe ka iwanu iwafilighwe na imwana nyalimwe. Litsuwa alyo lyose litsakuwa lya usungu.”<verse eid="AMO 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 8:11" />“IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino, Mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa nitsoghala nzala muisi, nayo si nzala ya chijo baye wala ng'ilu ya ghamatsi, lekeni nzala ayo itsakuwa nzala ya ukuhulika ghamalonga gha Imulungu. <verse eid="AMO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 8:12" />Iwanu watsakwanga kwanga kulawa bahali mbaka bahali ingi, watsolawa ubali wa kasikazini mbaka mashaliki, watsobama Lilonga lya IMNDEWA, lekeni ng'awatsolipata baye. <verse eid="AMO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 8:13" />Mna litsuwa alyo iwali iwadeghete na iwasongolo iwakindike watsotsilika kwa ukwona ng'ilu. <verse eid="AMO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 8:14" />Awala iwelaha kwa ichinyagho cha Samaria na kulonga, ‘Kwa taghwa lya mulungu wa Dani,’ au awala iwolonga, ‘Kwa litaghwa lya imulungu wa Beeri Sheba,’ Awo wose watsakughwa, na ng'awatsakwinuka keli baye.”<verse eid="AMO 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="AMO 9" />
  <para style="s">Ukuhigha kwa IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 9:1" />Tsanimwona IMNDEWA kema hambalimbali ha matsabahu, naye kanilaghitsa apfino, “Ghatowe ghamatwi gha tsingutso tsa ing'anda ya Imulungu mbaka pfitsingiti pfake pfihighisike, tsighwise tsingutso atso mna ghamatwi ghwa iwanu wose, awala iwohoneka nitsowakomela kuna ing'ondo, kutsakuwa kuduhu hata munu yumwe iyatsolekighwa mgima wala iyatsotsuma. <verse eid="AMO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 9:2" />Hata ka wohimba inzila ighenda hasi kutsimu, ako nitsowasola kwa ghumoko ghwangu, hata ka wogheluka kuchanya kulanga, kulawa kuko nitsowahulumsa hasi. <verse eid="AMO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 9:3" />Hata ka woghenda kwipfisa kuna ichidunda cha Karimeli, ako nitsowabama na kuwaghogha, hata ka wepfisa hasi ha ibahali ndeke kuwona, ako nitsolilaghitsa litsoka liwalume. <verse eid="AMO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 9:4" />Hata ka maaduwi tsawo watsowaghogha na kuwaghala kuna isi ya utumwa, ako nako nitsolaghitsa wakomighwe kuna ing'ondo, nitsotsodola tsinenge tsangu niwatendele ighehile na si ighanoghile baye.” <verse eid="AMO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 9:5" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu yana tsingupfu tsose yuyo iyodonza isi nayo yolubuka, na wose iwokala amwo wadomboketse, na isi yose yakwinuka na kughwa ka ghamatsi gha ghumto Naili ghwa Misiri pfaghomema na pfaghakuhwa. <verse eid="AMO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 9:6" />Yeye iyotsenga ing'anda yake ya chifalume kulanga na iyakwika ghumsingi ghwake muisi, yeye iyokema ghamatsi gha ibahali na kughamwagha mchanya mwa isi. Taghwa lyake IMNDEWA <verse eid="AMO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 9:7" />IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, “Angu kuna nene, mwemwe Waisiraeli si ka wanu wa Esiopia baye? Apfi mwemwe Waisiraeli siwalapfile baye kulawa Misiri? Angu Wafilisti siwalapfile baye kulawa Kafitoli na Washami kulawa Kiri? <verse eid="AMO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 9:8" />Lola, tsinenge tsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu tsolola ufalume una tsinzambi, na nene nitsoukoma ghendo, yanilonga apfo nene IMNDEWA.<verse eid="AMO 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 9:9" />“Kwaapfila nitsolapfa laghitso, na nitsowabeta iwanu wa Isiraeli iwali mna iwanu wa isi tsingi, ka apfila imunu iyobeta ingano kwa ilungo, na kuduhu hata mbeghu imwe inoghile itsolaghala hasi. <verse eid="AMO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 9:10" />Wana tsinzambi wose iwali mna iwanu wangu, watsokomighwa kung'ondo, awala iwolonga, ‘Ighehile ng'aghatsotupata baye, wala ng'atutsetingana nagho baye.’”<verse eid="AMO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wakuwa na ngupfu keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 9:11" />Mna litsuwa alyo nene nitsowimisa keli ufalume wa Daudi ughwile, nitsotsenga keli hanu ahala habomoke, nitsotsenga keli tsing'anda tsake tsibomoke, na nitsoitsenga keli iwe ka apfila pfaikalile ghumwande. <verse eid="AMO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 9:12" />Nawo Waisiraeli watsowaghogha iwanu wa Edomu iwasighale, na tsiisi tsose itsili tsangu. Yanilonga apfo nene IMNDEWA iyanitsotenda apfo.<verse eid="AMO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 9:13" />IMNDEWA kolonga apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">“Loleni, ghamatsuwa ghakutsa,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">ng'ana ghumsimu ghwa ukupfuna ghumale baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">ghumsimu ghwa ukulima ghutsopfika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">ng'ana ghumsimu ghwa ukubawa nzabibu ghumale baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">ghumsimu ghwa ukuhanda ghutsopfika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">Idipfai ya sambisambi itsomwaghika kulawa kuna ipfidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:13">na ipfighongo napfo pfitsolaghatsa idipfai.<verse eid="AMO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 9:14" />Nitsowoyitsa iwanu wangu Waisiraeli kulawa kuna isi ya utumwa kwawaghalighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">nawo watsoitsenga keli imiji yawo ihinyighwe na kukala mumo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">Watsohanda mitsabibu na kunwa idipfai yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:14">watsolima mighunda yawo na kuja ipfijo pfawopfuna.<verse eid="AMO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 9:15" />Nitsowatenda iwanu wangu Waisiraeli wakale mna isi yawo iwenyegho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:15">na ng'awatsolapfighwa keli baye kulawa mna isi yawo yaniweng'ile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="AMO 9:15">Yanilonga apfo nene IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu.<verse eid="AMO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 9" />
</usx>